 in each section; sections whose date has passed go under one fold at the bottom.
+
+A board.json with "due" instead of "section" is a task board: rows are sorted by owner and due date into nobody
+named / overdue / due by the next meeting / later, with done ones folded (see boards/tasks/board.json). An
+optional "rota" shows a weekly rota kept in two side columns of the same sheet.
